      "id": "claim_eba24461c4fe4d5d978c3f5aadc9e2aa",
      "statement": "Business mode is normalized to exactly `bbc` or `b2c`: the runtime default is `b2c`, and the legacy input `b2b` is treated as `bbc`; this normalized mode selects local templates and drives mode-dependent cart, checkout, recommendation, and distributor initialization behavior.",
